--- immutable list
  list: acyclic ctors=[0=acyclic; 1=acyclic]
--- mutable recursive variant
  node: cyclic ctors=[0=acyclic; 1=cyclic]
--- immutable recursive variant
  node: acyclic ctors=[0=acyclic; 1=acyclic]
--- wrapper points to a cyclic node
  node: cyclic ctors=[0=acyclic; 1=cyclic]
  wrapper: acyclic_n_trackable record=acyclic_n_trackable
--- constant-only record
  point: acyclic record=acyclic
--- anonymous aggregates
  object anon: acyclic
  object node: cyclic
  object anon: unknown_cyclic
--- array nodes
  array<i64>: acyclic
  array<box>: acyclic_n_trackable
--- nested array nodes
  array<array<box>>: acyclic_n_trackable
  array<box>: acyclic_n_trackable
